  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HP-Mainstreaming Mental Health in Nepal through Self Advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project advocates for and raises awareness of the human rights of the mentally ill in. It will conduct an in-depth study on existing legal provision in Nepal in line with the Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
